            "description_html": "<b>MNG 848, Riverstone 6 Inch Cup Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 6 Inch Riverstone Cabinet Cup Pull captures a rustic look while still looking fashionable. This Riverstone 6 Inch Cup Cabinet Pull is available in a few rustic farmhouse finishes. The Riverstone 6 Inch Pull comes packaged with the mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis cabinet pull is part of the <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=MNG+Riverstone\">MNG Riverstone Collection</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the MNG 848 Riverstone 6 Inch Cabinet Cup Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Base Material: Zinc </li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 6-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 1\" long #8-32 screws and 1-1/2\"  long #8-32 screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i> \r\n</p>",
